        "text": "The service moved its hosting management into a verification phase where the original data store still handles all user activity while a new database quietly checks itself against it. This internal step is strictly for the operators running the Freebuff service, ensuring the transition to the new storage system is safe before it fully takes over. You notice no changes in your daily use of the assistant, as your hosting remains fully served by the stable original system.",
